## Command

```shell
biome lint theme.css
```

## `biome.json`

```json
{
  "overrides": [
    { "includes": ["**/*.css"], "css": { "globals": ["theme.css"] } }
  ]
}
```

## `theme.css`

```css
.theme {
  color: red;
}
```

